      "status": "approve",
      "reasoning": "All six added formulas contain one Fe, two ammonium ions, two sulfate groups and six waters. Direct TOGO M2716/M1094/M940/M3164/M2560/M3118 and JCM950/966 contexts corroborate the same ferrous ammonium sulfate hexahydrate as CHEBI76181. M940 dissolves this solute in HCl first; that preparation does not make the whole acidic stock a synonym. The composition preserves both authors' source attributions and histories without replacing the frozen identifier, mapping, properties, occurrence statistics or roles. Existing unqualified/stock synonyms and full-owner holds remain.",
